========================================================================
  THE CLEAN ASYMPTOTIC TABLE
========================================================================

  V_n × n! / 2^{C(n,2)} = 1 + Σ_{k=3,5,7,...} (1/k) × n↓k × 2^{Δ_k} + cross terms

  where Δ_k = (k-1)(k+1-2n)/2 and n↓k = n!/(n-k)!

  LEADING TERMS:
  k=3: (1/3) × n(n-1)(n-2) × 2^{4-2n}
  k=5: (1/5) × n(n-1)(n-2)(n-3)(n-4) × 2^{12-4n}
  k=7: (1/7) × n↓7 × 2^{24-6n}

  EXPONENT PATTERN: Δ_k = (k-1)(k+1-2n)/2
  k=3: 4-2n     (pole at x = 2^2 = 4)
  k=5: 12-4n    (pole at x = 2^4 = 16)
  k=7: 24-6n    (pole at x = 2^6 = 64)
  k=9: 40-8n    (pole at x = 2^8 = 256)

  The constant terms: 4, 12, 24, 40, ... = k(k-1)/2 - (k-1) = (k-1)(k-2)/2 + (k-1)/2
  Actually: (k-1)(k+1)/2 = 4, 12, 24, 40 for k=3,5,7,9.
  Yes: (k²-1)/2.

  k   | Δ_k          | coefficient     | pole       | weight 1/k
  ------------------------------------------------------------
  3   | 4 - 2n    | (1/3)×n↓3    | 2^{2}=4     | 1/3 = 0.333333
  5   | 12 - 4n    | (1/5)×n↓5    | 2^{4}=16    | 1/5 = 0.200000
  7   | 24 - 6n    | (1/7)×n↓7    | 2^{6}=64    | 1/7 = 0.142857
  9   | 40 - 8n    | (1/9)×n↓9    | 2^{8}=256   | 1/9 = 0.111111
  11  | 60 - 10n   | (1/11)×n↓11   | 2^{10}=1024  | 1/11 = 0.090909
  13  | 84 - 12n   | (1/13)×n↓13   | 2^{12}=4096  | 1/13 = 0.076923
  15  | 112 - 14n   | (1/15)×n↓15   | 2^{14}=16384 | 1/15 = 0.066667
  17  | 144 - 16n   | (1/17)×n↓17   | 2^{16}=65536 | 1/17 = 0.058824
  19  | 180 - 18n   | (1/19)×n↓19   | 2^{18}=262144 | 1/19 = 0.052632

